Rule 4     declaracao -> TIPO lista_ids PV
Rule 5     lista_ids -> ID
Rule 6     lista_ids -> lista_ids VIRG ID

Terminals, with rules where they appear

ID                   : 5 6
PV                   : 4
TIPO                 : 4
VIRG                 : 6
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

